          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[var(--color-accent-ink)]">PAIN 01 · PRIMARY</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-[var(--color-ink-faint)] font-mono">Indelible portfolio</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl mb-2 leading-tight">"How do I leverage the portfolio for extra value, downstream to the companies?"</h3>
