            <span class="text-xs text-[var(--color-ink-faint)] font-mono">AI Salon Thailand</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl mb-2 leading-tight">"HQ rolled out a bad platform — Eventbrite to Luma, then WhatsApp hit max."</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] leading-relaxed">
