          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-paper)] p-5 border-l-4 border-l-[var(--color-success)]" data-reveal="fade-up" data-reveal-delay="2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[var(--color-success)]">PAIN 03 · ALUMNI</span>
